{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"a park in Chile (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Paul_II_Park_(Santiago)\" title=\"John Paul II Park (Santiago)\">a park in Chile</a></b>  features a 7-metre-tall (23<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>ft) statue of Pope John Paul<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>II covered in plants <i>(pictured)</i><span style=\"padding-left:0.15em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span></span>","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Paul_II_Park_(Santiago)","retrieved":1785485783340},{"title":"Pirngadi (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pirngadi\" title=\"Pirngadi\">Pirngadi</a></b> mapped Indonesia's ethnic groups for the 1931 <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paris_Colonial_Exposition\" title=\"Paris Colonial Exposition\">Paris Colonial Exposition</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pirngadi","retrieved":1785485783553},{"title":"Madonna's new film (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confessions_II_(film)\" title=\"Confessions II (film)\">Madonna's new film</a></b> features <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Debi_Mazar\" title=\"Debi Mazar\">Debi Mazar</a>, with whom she used to party in the 1980s before either of them was famous?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Confessions_II_(film)","retrieved":1785485783554},{"title":"Theo Faiss (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theo_Faiss\" title=\"Theo Faiss\">Theo Faiss</a></b> was remembered by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rudolf_Steiner\" title=\"Rudolf Steiner\">Rudolf Steiner</a> after his death as \"You dear Sun-Boy, you\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theo_Faiss","retrieved":1785485783554},{"title":"Um, Jennifer? (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Um,_Jennifer%3F\" title=\"Um, Jennifer?\">Um, Jennifer?</a></b> describe their music as \"slut rock\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Um,_Jennifer%3F","retrieved":1785485783555},{"title":"a Utah TV station (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KUTV\" title=\"KUTV\">a Utah TV station</a></b> was historically preferred by non-Mormon viewers?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/KUTV","retrieved":1785485783555},{"title":"Vitiges (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitiges\" title=\"Vitiges\">Vitiges</a></b> divorced his wife so that he could strengthen his legitimacy as king by forcibly marrying <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mataswintha\" title=\"Mataswintha\">the granddaughter</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Theodoric_the_Great\" title=\"Theodoric the Great\">Theodoric the Great</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vitiges","retrieved":1785485783555},{"title":"statue of Austin Blair (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Austin_Blair\" title=\"Statue of Austin Blair\">statue of Austin Blair</a></b>, according to the newspaper <i><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/City_Pulse\" title=\"City Pulse\">City Pulse</a></i>, is one of only two monuments in the United States to mention slavery as a cause of the American Civil War?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Statue_of_Austin_Blair","retrieved":1785485783555},{"title":"a charity photo shoot in 2007 (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Lionel Messi bathed a six-month-old Lamine Yamal for <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Messi–Yamal_photo_shoot\" title=\"2007 Messi–Yamal photo shoot\">a charity photo shoot in 2007</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Messi%E2%80%93Yamal_photo_shoot","retrieved":1785485783559},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;right&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Cologne&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;CologneBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Founded by the Romans, Germany's fourth largest city is known for its enormous cathedral and the Karneval in February.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7px;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);